<!--
  Seed Code Mail sitemap.
  The public pages are listed here: the landing page plus the Privacy Policy and
  the Terms of Service. Login, signup, password reset and the private application
  views are intentionally excluded — they are noindex, and they are hash routes
  rather than separate URLs.

  The legal URLs are given in their path form (/privacy, /terms) because that is
  the form Google's OAuth verification review expects and the form linked from
  the homepage footer's canonical address. vercel.json rewrites both to the
  single-page entry point, where the router renders the document.
-->
